0 26 488 [
[(The toggle button is a GUI \050Graphical User Interface\051 object that)]
[(outputs number values alternating between 0 \050when off\051 and a non)]
[(zero value when on \050default 1\051. It changes its state via clicks and)]
[(also when receiving bang messages. Floats are passed through and)]
[(the object changes its state when alternating between zero and)]
[(nonzero values. A set message changes the state without output.)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
grestore
